the factor is negative."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186504838 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "03bd2dae-9f93-5a40-8d4b-eef040995cd1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504744} {:answer/id #uuid "363e5073-dc2e-5bbf-8201-fe87b22042bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504774} {:answer/id #uuid "3e2d54b2-1153-5fc4-9a0e-c048e849ed9e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No such $λ$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504777} {:answer/id #uuid "5fd349ad-f11c-561b-b033-1a228c5244e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504789} {:answer/id #uuid "b507226d-14fb-5b7f-9ec4-42ba988fbde3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504816}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5fd349ad-f11c-561b-b033-1a228c5244e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504789} :answer-field/id #uuid "22efb133-43d7-5ecd-b9af-451a0d3ef57a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504762}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "f0dc3593-c754-5805-816a-41c4fccabc8f" :question/problem "Given that $3a + 24b$ and $λ(0.5a + 4b)$ are equal (non-zero) vectors, find the scale factor $λ$." :question/worked-solution "Notice that\n\n$$\nλ(\\frac{1}{2}a + 4b)=λ\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)a+λ(4)b.\n$$\n\nThe same scale factor must multiply the whole non-zero vector. Comparing the two coefficients gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nλ &= \\frac{3}{\\frac{1}{2}} = 6 \\\\\nλ &= \\frac{24}{4} = 6\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that\n\n$$\n3a + 24b=6(\\frac{1}{2}a + 4b).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nλ=6\n$$\n\nThe two non-zero vectors are parallel. Their directions are the same because the factor is positive."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186504839 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "150e0fae-7ea0-5e55-aa28-b1cf2c56b250" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504754} {:answer/id #uuid "63109784-3c77-52c6-a07b-5fa548fbd809" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504790} {:answer/id #uuid "6e8036ee-262d-5fb7-9adf-3a8cb2f1b4ff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504795} {:answer/id #uuid "8fad182c-2996-57a2-982a-7cc91e8a14de" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504805} {:answer/id #uuid "bf945500-ba30-51dc-a6bf-5f492b1428ad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No such $λ$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504820}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6e8036ee-262d-5fb7-9adf-3a8cb2f1b4ff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504795} :answer-field/id #uuid "291021b9-5572-5413-9bb4-fde113118354" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504769}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "f0e435c8-cd66-5b3b-b59e-c0b5f48a6d99" :question/problem "Given that $-a - 2b$ and $λ(0.5a + b)$ are equal (non-zero) vectors, find the scale factor $λ$." :question/worked-solution "Notice that\n\n$$\nλ(\\frac{1}{2}a + b)=λ\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)a+λ(1)b.\n$$\n\nThe same scale factor must multiply the whole non-zero vector. Comparing the two coefficients gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nλ &= \\frac{-1}{\\frac{1}{2}} = -2 \\\\\nλ &= \\frac{-2}{1} = -2\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that\n\n$$\n-a - 2b=-2(\\frac{1}{2}a + b).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nλ=-2\n$$\n\nThe two non-zero vectors are parallel. Their directions are opposite because the factor is negative."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186504841 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02744260-786b-581b-bebf-224559456963" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No such $λ$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504743} {:answer/id #uuid "09936ac2-1ed8-53d0-82ca-5a6b53627566" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504747} {:answer/id #uuid "12e7b76d-5e1e-5390-a739-e2782334a3f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504752} {:answer/id #uuid "5af6bbb3-8848-549e-95e8-a2f91e265cff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504786} {:answer/id #uuid "d351f425-30a0-5241-b6f1-d174fd4ad59a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504826}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "09936ac2-1ed8-53d0-82ca-5a6b53627566" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504747} :answer-field/id #uuid "f7982156-61e4-5ee2-9ad6-4fd386440c55" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504843}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "f58264c5-b24b-55b5-b334-1e81505cb790" :question/problem "Given that $-24a + 6b$ and $λ(4a - b)$ are equal (non-zero) vectors, find the scale factor $λ$." :question/worked-solution "Notice that\n\n$$\nλ(4a - b)=λ(4)a+λ(-1)b.\n$$\n\nThe same scale factor must multiply the whole non-zero vector. Comparing the two coefficients gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nλ &= \\frac{-24}{4} = -6 \\\\\nλ &= \\frac{6}{-1} = -6\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that\n\n$$\n-24a + 6b=-6(4a - b).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nλ=-6\n$$\n\nThe two non-zero vectors are parallel. Their directions are opposite because the factor is negative."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186504863 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "89e26bbe-a817-539a-b5c9-be6506c0db3b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504926} {:answer/id #uuid "a83fa579-2e1c-5c9c-a54f-fb39b0fb170f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504944}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a83fa579-2e1c-5c9c-a54f-fb39b0fb170f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504944} :answer-field/id #uuid "750744fa-4268-560c-94aa-bcda09a12b5d" :answer-field/key "$b =-2e$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504913} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9c83165b-d5fd-5aef-92a0-c8953312f526" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504939} {:answer/id #uuid "ec6c6cd2-265c-56c1-a5d2-8e030d0852f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504993}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ec6c6cd2-265c-56c1-a5d2-8e030d0852f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186504993} :answer-fie