$\n\nII. $r=2p$\n\nIII. $q=-r$" :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is false. The vectors $s$ and $t$ are parallel and have the same direction. The magnitude of $s$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $t$. So, $s\\ne 3t$.\n\n- Statement II is true. The vectors $r$ and $p$ are parallel and have the same direction. The magnitude of $r$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $p$. So, $r=2p$.\n\n- Statement III is false. The vectors $q$ and $r$ are parallel and have opposite directions. The magnitude of $q$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $r$. So, $q\\ne -r$.\n\nTherefore, only statement II is true."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186628583 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "812e2bcc-c146-58d7-8367-4c919e3086c6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628597} {:answer/id #uuid "972190c2-6bac-5ce1-b6f0-f8dde8d5a799" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628601}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "972190c2-6bac-5ce1-b6f0-f8dde8d5a799" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628601} :answer-field/id #uuid "8792e7e9-419a-5266-b478-5ecdc6c82b4b" :answer-field/key "$d=2e$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628599} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e842bed5-351a-5507-a705-f2e2bd9d1798" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628612} {:answer/id #uuid "f2ea9cfb-d1f4-5e9c-9578-b24cba66a134" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628615}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e842bed5-351a-5507-a705-f2e2bd9d1798" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628612} :answer-field/id #uuid "b5de8833-2497-500f-931c-49c677cc2aea" :answer-field/key "$a=-b$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628605} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ca5e1234-f631-5013-b8fa-42722b9fe5ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628607} {:answer/id #uuid "d1af3295-ece5-531e-8880-9ab230307deb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628609}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d1af3295-ece5-531e-8880-9ab230307deb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628609} :answer-field/id #uuid "ff2dedd4-28e1-5848-a30b-a9b650dbc289" :answer-field/key "$d=-2e$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628616}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "3f3a2b79-75e1-5091-907c-0c44e8f36d34" :question/problem "![](images/7b/7b1496185812c5663cf8e07b02a8e51f9c3b07393d4c08d988cbf1fcd3179a06.png)\n\nConsider the diagram that is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is true. The vectors $d$ and $e$ are parallel and have opposite directions. The magnitude of $d$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $e$. So, $d=-2e$.\n\n- Statement II is false. The vectors $a$ and $b$ are parallel and have the same direction. The magnitude of $a$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $b$. So, $a\\ne -b$.\n\n- Statement III is false. The vectors $d$ and $e$ are parallel and have opposite directions. The magnitude of $d$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $e$. So, $d\\ne 2e$.\n\nTherefore, only statement I is true."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186628589 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b8dfad6-c081-53b4-aaa0-2e834483cc46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628586} {:answer/id #uuid "6df7ba2d-a2db-5442-b586-0e76962bcc46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628592}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6df7ba2d-a2db-5442-b586-0e76962bcc46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628592} :answer-field/id #uuid "27cc2e80-c5bb-53e5-8327-20592dc86c6e" :answer-field/key "$b=-\\frac{1}{2}d$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628582} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a76f318-9136-5ad7-a463-aa64f570a28c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628579} {:answer/id #uuid "dd62623f-e10f-59e5-82de-e1b025bb8248" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628610}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dd62623f-e10f-59e5-82de-e1b025bb8248" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628610} :answer-field/id #uuid "6867fa8d-25eb-5c06-a45e-330141e360cd" :answer-field/key "$a=e$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628591} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "403938a3-9935-53ed-bd80-1df23fc797d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628584} {:answer/id #uuid "af92a61b-92f1-5f91-83c1-7c6752a3458b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628604}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "af92a61b-92f1-5f91-83c1-7c6752a3458b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628604} :answer-field/id #uuid "bc6ba19f-647e-5cb0-ab75-03ba29feb426" :answer-field/key "$d=-b$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628606}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "5edf6afc-78ce-5695-b6e3-1a33f6ac3097" :question/problem "![](images/b6/b6c26d5365880d39ef1e5170dbfad0632ca60735727a6779b20059f7b18e8687.png)\n\nConsider the diagram that is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is false. The vectors $d$ and $b$ are parallel and have opposite directions. The magnitude of $d$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $b$. So, $d\\ne -b$.\n\n- Statement II is true. The vectors $b$ and $d$ are parallel and have opposite directions. The magnitude of $b$ is $\\frac{1}{2}$ times the magnitude of $d$. So, $b=-\\frac{1}{2}d$.\n\n- Statement III is false. The vectors $a$ and $e$ are parallel and have the same direction. The magnitude of $a$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $e$. So, $a\\ne e$.\n\nTherefore, only statement II is true."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186628594 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "794da91f-723c-5590-b235-67d7005fbeaf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628593} {:answer/id #uuid "7f863861-129d-5963-b3a9-3fa2294f8978" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628595} {:answer/id #uuid "80b1864b-7947-54ef-90b9-4982b447a2fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628596} {:answer/id #uuid "9f7b4c01-27ac-54ff-a091-389aa6d8cbcf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628602} {:answer/id #uuid "cb5f5624-fdfe-5e90-9150-b1872ea07148" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628608}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cb5f5624-fdfe-5e90-9150-b1872ea07148" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628608} :answer-field/id #uuid "8417fba8-92a0-5d30-8475-2df3d791c2cd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628598}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "79a05414-7032-5178-a92c-c08b89d2f3cd" :question/problem "![](images/7a/7ad3dd07f782811a42c9e0b06299a95c4d0ce984bdbdabd5f952ef0f6820155f.png)\n\nConsider the diagram that is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $a=-z$\n\nII. $m=k$\n\nIII. $z=-\\frac{1}{2}a$" :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is false. The vectors $a$ and $z$ are parallel and have the same direction. The magnitude of $a$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $z$. So, $a\\ne -z$.\n\n- Statement II is true. The vectors $m$ and $k$ are parallel and have the same direction. The magnitude of $m$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $k$. So, $m=k$.\n\n- Statement III is false. The vectors $z$ and $a$ are parallel and have the same direction. The magnitude of $z$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $a$. So, $z\\ne -\\frac{1}{2}a$.\n\nTherefore, only statement II is true."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186628603 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19dbc5e2-305b-56d2-977a-01ec8053b29c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628578} {:answer/id #uuid "1f7dea34-2eb3-5394-bc4c-ce9ccccda263" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628581} {:answer/id #uuid "8cb087b0-2225-5159-8fb1-25c98e9128a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628600} {:answer/id #uuid "e997689c-5678-5f00-a4db-d0f7367a8d1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628613} {:answer/id #uuid "ef0777be-960b-5991-9242-395252a2b036" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628614}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8cb087b0-2225-5159-8fb1-25c98e9128a7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628600} :answer-field/id #uuid "411ada06-786f-5ee8-bc0d-900b4cf4067c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186628585}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "a98b3fb4-9dbe-550d-8f88-85d63dacb822" :question/problem "![](images/b4/b4a29b1ca13d5ddcb342f247b8b477058586bdad0bb4a6af588d66ef15f9df3c.png)\n\nConsider the diagram that is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $r=3p$\n\nII. $q=2t$\n\nIII. $s=-q$" :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is false. The vectors $r$ and $p$ are parallel and have the same direction. The magnitude of $r$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $p$. So, $r\\ne 3p$.\n\n- Statement II is false. The vectors $q$ and $t$ are parallel and have opposite directions. The magnitude of $q$ is $2$ times the magnitude of $t$. So, $q\\ne 2t$.\n\n- Statement III is true. The vectors $s$ and $q$ are parallel and have opposite directions. The magnitude of $s$ is $1$ times the magnitude of $q$. So, $s=-q$.\n\nTherefore, only statement III is true."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186666149 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "57a578f8-1ece-5c2f-be8d-2dbd1bce61af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/62/6218302c2dd4d0bf78ef769d48213b7fdb0dd7ff70ad22e3f85bd1d1cad953b1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186665649} {:answer/id #uuid "5bbcf8f9-4005-5caf-8460-d19ae13341c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/10/10ba1d9422092084750db846117cf763b5abbee80a023df4d088068acba649f5.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186665652} {:answer/id #uuid "6306b026-c382-522a-8a75-39dddd09ccca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/20/209ba8dff016565e37b81622ec03de1ca298cd834db5edd76f6cfae39de5ec4a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186665664} {:answer/id #uuid "65f6cb99-17bb-50a5-ba6b-3439ff6e692a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/a4/a433a81364c56272ede42df96f1d74c1bde89ae95faa2a912c91e80897cd11b8.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186665669} {:answer/id #uuid "f7d1b3ae-cb8d-5f79-a70e-9ea8e5566093" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d9/d93132ed562821d74f0ad56973cb094cf5d17e214e3933add9f4ce1bcb4262ff.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186665897}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "57a578f8-1ece-5c2f-be8d-2dbd1bce61af" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/62/6218302c2dd4d0bf78ef769d48213b7fdb0dd7ff70ad22e3f85bd1d1cad953b1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186665649} :answer-field/id #uuid "b0dbff45-2731-51df-a2c1-272158c9f247" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186666014}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "fcec4249-eee2-539a-8cc6-94fc3561f052" :question/math-academy-id "q-119067" :question/problem "![](images/a4/a43e4291dcbe0819d5c320b21805c992f32789123622ab01e7d407a45540defc.png)\n\nThe vector $a$ is depicted above. Which of the following diagrams shows the vectors $\\frac{3}{2}a$ and $-4a?$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that both $\\frac{3}{2}a$ and $-4a$ must be parallel to $a.$\n\nNow, for the vector $\\frac{3}{2}a$ we have the following:\n\n- The magnitude of $\\frac{3}{2}a$ is $\\frac{3}{2}$ of the magnitude of $a.$\n\n- Vectors $a$ and $\\frac{3}{2}a$ have the same direction since the factor $\\frac{3}{2}$ is positive.\n\n![](images/59/59aa29fdfd338165f1b6fa8cd3a4d2a8d30fae92023ab855b0df88e38a24c5cd.png)\n\n \n\nNext, for the vector $-4a$ we have the following:\n\n- The magnitude of $-4a$ is $4$ times the magnitude of $a.$\n\n- Vectors $a$ and $-4a$ have opposite directions since the factor $-4$ is negative.\n\nTherefore, the correct diagram is the following.\n\n![](images/aa/aab2a72ca63e9142f502bbfbf2c5dd31d3a452860422d6088bf75ae060ef29b6.png)"}]}
